# Daily Grid backend.
#
# Both values come from your Supabase project's API settings page
# (Project Settings → API). Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the
# values — never commit the filled-in copy.
#
# Expo SDK 54+ inlines any var prefixed with EXPO_PUBLIC_ at build
# time. The Supabase anon key is intentionally public — it's the
# unprivileged client identity, and Row Level Security in the
# database is the actual access boundary.

EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
